# What Shimpaku needs on every device: gNMI in clear text on 32767 in the management instance
# (docs/RESEARCH.md R2; the collector dials in with the lab credentials). Lab-only: no TLS.
set system services http servers server shimpaku-gnmi port 32767
set system services http servers server shimpaku-gnmi routing-instance mgmt_junos
set system services http servers server shimpaku-gnmi grpc gnmi
# r1 protects its routing engine (PROTECT-RE on lo0): let the collector in.
set firewall family inet filter PROTECT-RE term mgmt from destination-port 32767
